# Run artifacts. The harness writes report.json, summary.md, answers.jsonl and
# verdicts.jsonl under results/runs/<run-id>/ plus whatever memory the system
# under test built. None of it is source, and the built memory can reach
# hundreds of megabytes, so a run is kept by whoever produced it.
results/
